# Store Performance Guide

Agency reference for storefront performance. Applies to themes using the **climaybe perf kit** (critical CSS, JS tiering, resource blocker, LCP preloads). Per-store fonts, GTM, and app embeds differ — see §14.

Read this before adding scripts, third-party tags, CSS, or heavy Liquid to `<head>`.

## Goals & budgets

| Metric | Target | Primary levers |
|--------|--------|----------------|
| LCP | < 2.5s | Head preloads, critical CSS, `cols` image sizing, woff2 + preload discipline |
| INP / TBT | Low main-thread blocking | Deferred JS, smaller `index.js`, idle third-parties |
| CLS | Stable layout | Explicit image dimensions, `font-display: swap`, `ascent-override` |
| Third-party cost | Contained | Resource blocker, `content_for_header` sanitization, defer marketing |

**Source of truth for JS:** `_scripts/` → `assets/` via `npm run scripts:build` (climaybe bundler). **Never edit `assets/*.js` directly.**

---

## Page load timeline

```
┌─ HEAD (critical path) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ 1. _head-resource-blocker     Network + DOM patches (first script)         │
│ 2. _head-urgent-script        Geoblock / urgent redirects (if enabled)     │
│ 3. _meta-tags, _head-seo      Meta, favicons (low fetchpriority)           │
│ 4. LCP preloads (template):                                                │
│    • _product-preload-slider-images     PDP                                │
│    • _index-preload-hero                Homepage                           │
│    • _collection-preload-first-product  Standard collection                │
│    • _collection-preload-model-hero     auto-template-v3 model pages       │
│ 5. _head-typography           Preconnect budget                            │
│ 6. _head-style                woff2 @font-face, :root, critical.css,     │
│                               style.css (async)                            │
│ 7. _script-variables          window.theme, routes, icons                   │
│ 8. index.js + route bundles   productpage.js / collectionpage.js in head   │
│ 9. speculationrules           Conservative prerender (if enabled)            │
│10. content_for_header         Shopify apps — sanitized after capture        │
│11. Post-header cleanup         Removes blocked script/link nodes            │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
┌─ BODY ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Main content (sections/snippets)                                           │
│ _body-script → deferred.js (module, end of body)                           │
│   → scheduleIdle imports (find-your-car, related-products, etc.)           │
│   → per-store deferred integrations (Trusted Shops, Klaviyo, Hotjar…)    │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
