## 1. CSS tiering

### Critical bundle (render-blocking)

- **Source:** `_styles/critical.css` → `assets/critical.css`
- **Scope:** Header + first-paint hero shell; narrow `@source` list
- **Loaded in:** `snippets/_head-style.liquid` via `stylesheet_tag`

When adding above-the-fold UI to header or index hero, extend critical `@source` paths or accept FOUC until full CSS loads.

### Full stylesheet (non-blocking)

- **Source:** `_styles/main.css` → `assets/style.css`
- **Pattern:** `media="print" onload="this.media='all'"` + `<noscript>` fallback
- **Also:** `rel="preload" as="style" fetchpriority="high"` for early discovery

Build: `climaybe build` or `climaybe serve` (compiles `_styles/critical.css` and `_styles/main.css` when present).

### Lazysizes

**Removed.** Native `loading="lazy"` / `fetchpriority` only. Do not reintroduce lazysizes or `data-srcset` placeholders.

---

## 2. Font strategy

### Self-hosted woff2 (no Typekit / Google Fonts on storefront)

- Store font files in `assets/*.woff2`
- Declare in `_head-style.liquid` with `font-display: swap` and `ascent-override: 90%` on display/body faces
- **Preload at most 2 files** — default body 400 + display/heading 400 (LCP text weights)
- Remaining weights load on demand when CSS requests them

**Example (Voldt):** `nhtr.woff2` (body 400), `nhdr.woff2` (display 400); `nhtm`, `nhtb`, `nhdm` without preload.

**Example (II):** `grosa-medium.woff2`, `ivypresto-headline-light.woff2` preloaded.

### Font blocking

`_head-resource-blocker.liquid` + `layout/theme.liquid` sanitization block:

- Adobe Typekit, Google Fonts, Shopify Font CDN (Nunito), Klaviyo legacy brand fonts
- Rebuy onsite CDN (`cdn.rebuyengine.com`, `/onsite/`) — API (`rebuyengine.com/api/*`) still allowed

### Preconnect budget

`_head-typography.liquid`: `cdn.shopify.com`, `cdn.shopifycloud.com` only. Drop unused `fonts.shopifycdn.com`, `shop.app`.

