## 4. Third-party containment

### Layer 1: Resource blocker

`snippets/_head-resource-blocker.liquid` — **first in `<head>`**. Patches fetch, XHR, DOM insertion, late injections.

### Layer 2: Header sanitization

`layout/theme.liquid` captures `content_for_header`, replaces blocked hosts with `blocked.invalid/*`, runs cleanup script.

### Layer 3: Deferred / conditional loading

| Integration | Typical pattern |
|-------------|-----------------|
| Trusted Shops | `trusted-shops-deferred.js` in `deferred.js`, idle inject |
| GTM (theme) | `window.load` in `_head-script.liquid` — **client approval before changes** |
| GTM (Customer Events) | Shopify admin custom pixel — not in theme git |
| Klaviyo / Hotjar / Rebuy | Per-store `deferred.js` imports or app embeds |

### GTM policy

- Copy `docs/gtm-audit-template.md` (climaybe) → theme `docs/gtm-audit-{store}.md` at audit time
- Document containers, sources, and open questions before any GTM change
- **Do not merge, remove, or consent-gate** until marketing confirms
- Watch for **double bootstrap** (theme + Customer Events loading same container ID)

