## 5. Images & LCP

### Sizing: use `cols`, not ad-hoc width params

`a--image.liquid` / `a--image-responsive.liquid` derive width from grid columns:

```
width ≈ cols × 105px   →  cols: 4 ≈ 420w, retina 840w
```

Pass `sm_cols`, `md_cols`, `lg_cols` from product cards and heroes. **Do not invent** `fixed_width`, `grid_image_widths`, or `image_fixed_width` atom params.

### LCP image rules

- `lazyload: false` + `fetchpriority: 'high'` on confirmed LCP element
- `three_x_retina_mobile: false` on full-bleed heroes (cap mobile at 2x)
- Native `src` / `srcset` — no `width=20` placeholder + `data-srcset`

### Collection grid (Voldt pattern)

- All cards: `lg_cols: 4` → 420/840
- First item only: `col-span-2` landscape hero; row 1 = 3 products on desktop
- First 3 cards eager (`forloop_index < 4`), rest lazy
- Keep `{% for %}` inside a single `{% liquid %}` block — do not break loops across liquid tags

### Preloads (head snippets)

| Snippet | When | Mobile target |
|---------|------|---------------|
| `_index-preload-hero.liquid` | `index` | 420w + 840w `imagesrcset`, `settings.homepage_lcp_image` |
| `_product-preload-slider-images.liquid` | `product` | First slider images (match PDP `cols`) |
| `_collection-preload-first-product.liquid` | `collection` (not model template) | First grid product featured image |
| `_collection-preload-model-hero.liquid` | `template.suffix == 'auto-template-v3'` | `collection.image` hero, not first product |

Preload URL must match the **actual LCP `<img>`** width on mobile (verify in DevTools Network).

### `a--image-responsive.liquid`

Used for hero banners and overlay cards. After lazysizes removal, must output real `src`/`srcset`. Hero cards: `sm_cols: 4`, `lazyload: false`.

