## 6. Navigation & prefetch

### Speculation Rules

`snippets/_head-script.liquid` — `eagerness: "conservative"`, exclude account/cart/login. Do not add instant.page alongside this.

### electric-section (Section Rendering API)

`IntersectionObserver` lazy fetch (`data-onload`, `data-onload-root-margin`). Used for tabs, header fragments, below-fold sections.

### Cart script on demand

Inject `cart.js` when cart drawer opens — not on every page upfront (if theme implements lazy cart bundle).

---

## 7. Adding new features — checklist

### New JavaScript

- [ ] Source in `_scripts/`, run `npm run scripts:build`
- [ ] PDP-only → add `import` to `productpage.js`, **not** a Liquid `<script>` tag
- [ ] Collection-only → `collectionpage.js`
- [ ] Every page, non-critical → `deferred.js` + `scheduleIdle`
- [ ] Cart fetches → inline `fetch()` headers (no `fetchConfig`)

### New third-party script

- [ ] Prefer GTM + consent (client-owned) over theme `<head>` sync tags
- [ ] Add conflicting domains to resource blocker
- [ ] Never add sync analytics in critical head without perf review

### New above-the-fold UI

- [ ] Extend `critical.css` `@source` if needed
- [ ] LCP image: preload snippet + `cols` sizing + `lazyload: false`
- [ ] Max 2 font preloads

### New product card / grid images

- [ ] Use existing `cols` / `lg_cols` on `a--image`
- [ ] Eager load only first row / LCP candidates

